### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 72/100.** Evidence LiveBench live audio ~70%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 72/100.** Evidence HLE live ~40%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 131K per session / 65K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 90/100.** Text, image, video, audio in; text, audio out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 70/100.** Evidence LiveCode live ~70%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 82/100.** $0.75/$3.75 per 1M live audio.
- **Overall Score: 75/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (72+72+70+90+70)/5=74.8 → 75; best-fit per scoring methodology.

